<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sales.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sales.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Thursday's wool sales at Napier and Christchurch was 463 NZ cents per kg clean, Wools of New Zealand said on Friday.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean), were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - 977</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - 599</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 387</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - 444</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom +64 4 473 4746</p>
